oke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMATHI-68\" d=\"M137 683Q138 683 209 688T282 694Q294 694 294 685Q294 674 258 534Q220 386 220 383Q220 381 227 388Q288 442 357 442Q411 442 444 415T478 336Q478 285 440 178T402 50Q403 36 407 31T422 26Q450 26 474 56T513 138Q516 149 519 151T535 153Q555 153 555 145Q555 144 551 130Q535 71 500 33Q466 -10 419 -10H414Q367 -10 346 17T325 74Q325 90 361 192T398 345Q398 404 354 404H349Q266 404 205 306L198 293L164 158Q132 28 127 16Q114 -11 83 -11Q69 -11 59 -2T48 16Q48 30 121 320L195 616Q195 629 188 632T149 637H128Q122 643 122 645T124 664Q129 683 137 683Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-76\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"763\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1819,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"60\" y=\"-686\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-3C0\" x=\"2680\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3253,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-72\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"638\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-68\" x=\"4158\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Before we differentiate the equation with respect to time, note that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.049ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 451.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">r</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMATHI-72\" d=\"M21 287Q22 290 23 295T28 317T38 348T53 381T73 411T99 433T132 442Q161 442 183 430T214 408T225 388Q227 382 228 382T236 389Q284 441 347 441H350Q398 441 422 400Q430 381 430 363Q430 333 417 315T391 292T366 288Q346 288 334 299T322 328Q322 376 378 392Q356 405 342 405Q286 405 239 331Q229 315 224 298T190 165Q156 25 151 16Q138 -11 108 -11Q95 -11 87 -5T76 7T74 17Q74 30 114 189T154 366Q154 405 128 405Q107 405 92 377T68 316T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-72\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> also appears in the formula. So, we need to simplify the formula by writing <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.049ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 451.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">r</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E15-MJMATHI-72\" d=\"M21 287Q22 290 23 295T28 317T38 348T53 381T73 411T99 433T132 442Q161 442 183 430T214 408T225 388Q227 382 228 382T236 389Q284 441 347 441H350Q398 441 422 400Q430 381 430 363Q430 333 417 315T391 292T366 288Q346 288 334 299T322 328Q322 376 378 392Q356 405 342 405Q286 405 239 331Q229 315 224 298T190 165Q156 25 151 16Q138 -11 108 -11Q95 -11 87 -5T76 7T74 17Q74 30 114 189T154 366Q154 405 128 405Q107 405 92 377T68 316T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E15-MJMATHI-72\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> in terms of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.986ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 855 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-16-Title\">h.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E16-MJMATHI-68\" d=\"M137 683Q138 683 209 688T282 694Q294 694 294 685Q294 674 258 534Q220 386 220 383Q220 381 227 388Q288 442 357 442Q411 442 444 415T478 336Q478 285 440 178T402 50Q403 36 407 31T422 26Q450 26 474 56T513 138Q516 149 519 151T535 153Q555 153 555 145Q555 144 551 130Q535 71 500 33Q466 -10 419 -10H414Q367 -10 346 17T325 74Q325 90 361 192T398 345Q398 404 354 404H349Q266 404 205 306L198 293L164 158Q132 28 127 16Q114 -11 83 -11Q69 -11 59 -2T48 16Q48 30 121 320L195 616Q195 629 188 632T149 637H128Q122 643 122 645T124 664Q129 683 137 683Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E16-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMATHI-68\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"576\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Note that the cones formed by the tank and the chemical must be similar. Therefore, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"9.186ex\" height=\"18.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -8.496ex; m